    {
      "text": "In light of the United States Supreme Court’s denial of the federal government’s application for a stay in Trump v. Illinois , No. 25A443 (U.S. Dec. 23, 2025), the parties are directed to confer about the procedural next steps for this appeal. By Wednesday, January 7, 2026, the parties shall file either: (a) a joint proposal if agreement is reached or (b) separate proposals if no agreement is reached.",
